sequenceDiagram
actor Researcher as Researcher
participant ModelEvaluationPage as Boundary: ModelEvaluationPage
participant ModelGovernanceControl as Control: ModelGovernanceControl
participant Model as Entity: Model
Researcher->>ModelEvaluationPage: Request model evaluation
ModelEvaluationPage->>ModelGovernanceControl: Authorize and validate inputs
ModelGovernanceControl->>Model: Load registered artifact digest
Model-->>ModelGovernanceControl: Return model and dataset metadata
ModelGovernanceControl-->>ModelEvaluationPage: Run or retrieve validated metrics
ModelEvaluationPage-->>Researcher: Display reproducible result
